NC Digital provides local SEO services for businesses in Barry — helping you rank higher on Google when people in the Vale of Glamorgan search for your services.

## Why local SEO matters for Barry businesses

Most people searching for a local service click one of the top three results on Google. If you're not there, you're invisible to them. Local SEO gets your business ranking for the searches that matter — "electrician Barry", "café Barry Island", "accountant Vale of Glamorgan" — the terms your customers are already using.

## What's included in our local SEO service

- Local keyword research — the exact terms your customers search
- Google Business Profile optimisation
- On-page SEO — page titles, headings, meta descriptions, schema markup
- Local citation building and directory listings
- Content strategy to target local search terms
- Monthly reporting with keyword rankings and traffic data

